  "basis": "The routing criterion is to select the highest-risk state from the dashboard. The available options are RI, NM, and DE. RI is gray, which is not represented in the visible legend and thus has no assigned risk value. NM is dark burgundy-red, indicating a low risk value (near 0). DE is orange-red, indicating a medium risk value (between 20 and 40). Therefore, DE is the only offered state with a defined risk value, and it is the highest among the eligible options.",
  "option_label": "Open Delaware (DE) risk detail for routine monitoring"
}
